{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/giffy2_ampumista.gif?t=1745168453\" /><i><br><br><strong>Another\u00a0action-packed crime romp from the infamous PAKO series!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAKO 4 is an atmospheric and violent indie action game where the player causes chaos in a big city by committing various crimes with his accomplice and escaping the police. The game is shot from a third-person view and you can move around the city on foot or by car. Fast paced arcade mechanics from Pako 2 meet more in depth missions varying from escorting people to doing all kinds of hi-jinx around the North Paw area! Come and enjoy the old school feel of doing crimes!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/giffy4_sporttikaara.gif?t=1745168453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player action game: drive and walk freely around in the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Complete various missions, such as bank robberies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro inspired graphics of the early 2000 games we all loved!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together with a npc buddy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your car breaks down, keep escaping on foot and take another: every car is drivable!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot twin-stick style and destroy stuff!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different camera angle options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game radio channels bringing the bangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take screenshots in Photo Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More features coming during Early Access!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We encourage people to give their feedback, ideas and just generally talk stuff at the Community Hub, we are eager to listen what you are wishing for!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Errand Boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425320/ecd0042b9d1f9c71f947f50c833608acbf32313f.jpg"},{"name":"Petty Criminal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425320/ecd0042b9d1f9c71f947f50c833608acbf32313f.jpg"},{"name":"Partners in crime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3425320/11f025ceb669f07dd9adcf572ed828d2e1eb54c2.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3425320?t=1745168453","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3425320?t=1745168453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/f2ba903a77061af194f29d262ff6ee4a4983a043/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745168453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/f2ba903a77061af194f29d262ff6ee4a4983a043/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745168453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/giffy2_ampumista.gif?t=1745168453\" /><i><br><br><strong>Another\u00a0action-packed crime romp from the infamous PAKO series!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAKO 4 is an atmospheric and violent indie action game where the player causes chaos in a big city by committing various crimes with his accomplice and escaping the police. The game is shot from a third-person view and you can move around the city on foot or by car. Fast paced arcade mechanics from Pako 2 meet more in depth missions varying from escorting people to doing all kinds of hi-jinx around the North Paw area! Come and enjoy the old school feel of doing crimes!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/extras/giffy4_sporttikaara.gif?t=1745168453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player action game: drive and walk freely around in the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Complete various missions, such as bank robberies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro inspired graphics of the early 2000 games we all loved!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together with a npc buddy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your car breaks down, keep escaping on foot and take another: every car is drivable!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot twin-stick style and destroy stuff!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different camera angle options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game radio channels bringing the bangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take screenshots in Photo Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More features coming during Early Access!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We encourage people to give their feedback, ideas and just generally talk stuff at the Community Hub, we are eager to listen what you are wishing for!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["Tree Men Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425320/header.jpg?t=1745168453","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class